Problem , Functional Requirements
Leetcode is a platform using which you can practise questions, submit the solutions in the languge you want , get the repsonse that whether the solution is accepted or not , and then in competitions should also
be able to see the leaderboard. We will assume in the interview that the user is already logged in and it is stored in JWT or session.

Non Functional Requirements
The system should prioritize availabillity over consistency.
The system should return submission results within 5 seconds.
The system should scale to support competitions with 100000 users.
The system should support isolation and security when running user code.

